{"resourceIdentifier":"3068","resourceName":"DENIZLI ENERGY BIOGAS PLANT","description":"The project is a biogas-to-energy project that generates renewable energy by capturing biogas from animal manure -via anaerobic digestion- and utilizing it to produce thermal and electric energy through biogas systems. The project is being implemented by DENİZLİ BIYOGAZ ENERJİ URETIM ANONİM ŞİRKETİ, as the Project Owner, in Honaz district, Denizli province, in Turkey.\r\n\r\nCattle and chicken manure generated at farms and left to decay in anaerobic conditions are collected daily through special sewage trucks equipped with close tanks to prevent any odor and/or manure leakages and to be fed into the anaerobic digesters at the proposed biogas power plant.\r\n\r\nThe project has become operational by starting to generate electricity and feeding it directly to the Turkish national grid on June 3rd, 2021. The project has a total installed capacity of 1.501 MWe/h. \r\n\r\nThe project has obtained the approval of Environmental Impact Assessment (EIA) issued by the Ministry of Environment and Urbanization in Turkey on February 11th, 2022.\r\n\r\nThis project adopts the renewable crediting period of 7 years, twice renewable for a total of 21 years. The estimated average net annual emission reductions are 234,821 tCO2eq/y. Accordingly, the project is expected to generate 1,643,747 tCO2eq/y emissions reduction during the first crediting period.","location":{"latitude":37.771460,"longitude":29.344660},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-08-04","endExclusive":"2022-09-04","endInclusive":"2022-09-03"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3068"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Denizli"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"DENİZLİ BİYOGAZ ENERJİ ÜRETİM ANONİM ŞİRKETİ"},{"type":"string","value":"DENİZL, Turkey"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"3068"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"234821"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AM0073"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Tuev Sued Industrie Service GmbH (Tuev Sued)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"22/11/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 03/06/2021 - 02/06/2028"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=72032&IDKEY=miofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq3o99332128","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Denizli Energy Biogas Plant (ID3068)-Draft-Joint-Project-Description-Monitoring-Report-Template-v4.1_Clean_18072022.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-08-04T14:03:07.05Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=64826&IDKEY=998klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8d889395054","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS-Listing-Representation-Denizli Energy Biogas Plant-v4.1-120422.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-04-13T13:55:01.633Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=122981&IDKEY=aq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfhn169590799","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"Denizli Project (ID3068)_VCS-Joint-Project-Description-and-Monitoring-Report_version 5_301024_clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-11-22T10:00:38.353Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.